    "Small arithmetic proof timing is near neutral after confirmation; witness preparation improves. N512 batch 1 security 100 confirmation still includes an anomalously slow baseline seed 45 affecting proof and verification, so its apparent aggregate speedup should not be presented as a stable small-case gain.",
    "Full N1024 batch 1 security 100 has a confirmed observed 16-worker tradeoff: total prover +2.82%, proof +3.53%, verification +4.17% over eight fresh seeds. Six seeds show stable higher process medians rather than isolated slow samples; two seeds are near neutral. The source of this variation has not been established.",
    "Arithmetic N1024 batch 1024 process RSS increases consistently by approximately 7\u20138 MiB (3.45\u20133.83%) in the initial campaign; this is a process-lifetime high-water measurement, not a direct per-proof allocation measurement.",
    "The existing arithmetic BindingForm optimization is enabled only at workers 1 or 8; 16 workers use existing legacy preparation and terminal-weight evaluation. Dense word folds/source scans still parallelize. The harness accepts 16 without changing this policy."
  ],
