  "limitations": [
    "Results describe these frozen binaries, this machine, fixed CPU placement and sampled inputs; finite-sample bootstrap intervals do not prove universal nonregression.",
    "Paired geometric means are used consistently: dividing the separately listed geometric means reproduces the geometric mean of per-seed ratios. Median-of-seed-medians totals need not reproduce those ratios.",
    "The 16-versus-8 observations come from separate campaigns. They include existing worker-dependent algorithm policies and possible temporal effects, so they are not a controlled pure core-scaling experiment.",
    "Main and auxiliary workers share CPU 6 under the existing benchmark policy. All 16 physical cores are represented by the global worker pool; logical SMT sibling CPUs 16\u201331 are excluded.",
    "No builds, benchmarks or source edits were performed by this independent analysis task."
  ],
